  "title": "Qt: Fix leak in Conversation and Endpoint recent tabs",
  "description": "g_list_prepend creates a new list link with the data provides,\nso the old link has to be freed. Inserting the old link into the\nlist directly is more efficient, and newer GLib provides an API\ncall for that.\n\nOn older GLib we could manipulate the various list element prev\nand next pointers directly, since they are exposed in the API,\nto avoid creating a new link and freeing the old one, but this\nis a rare operation so it's probably not worth making the code\nharder to read.\n\nFixup 138d0438865d22cd1f09e2023fe2fd61bfe151ad",
